    <string name="server_required_label">Server required</string>
    <string name="server_required_note">DeltaSync requires a server. You or your administrator must have set one up (PHP + PostgreSQL), generated an enrollment token via the admin CLI, and given you the server URL. This app does not work standalone — it is a client to an already-running server.\n\nSee https://gitlab.com/Star95/keepass-deltasync for setup instructions.</string>

